    "Each agent gets its own isolated browser profile. Cookies and sign-ins persist between chats but are never shared with other agents or your regular browser." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Each agent gets its own isolated browser profile. Cookies and sign-ins persist between chats but are never shared with other agents or your regular browser."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Each agent gets its own isolated browser profile. Cookies and sign-ins persist between chats but are never shared with other agents or your regular browser."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Each agent gets its own isolated browser profile. Cookies and sign-ins persist between chats but are never shared with other agents or your regular browser."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个智能体都有自己的隔离浏览器配置文件。Cookie 和登录状态在聊天之间持续保留，但不会与其他智能体或你的常规浏览器共享。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個智能體都有自己的隔離瀏覽器設定檔。Cookie 和登入狀態在聊天之間持續保留，但不會與其他智能體或你的常規瀏覽器共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each provider only receives the settings it accepts. If a provider cannot use a setting, the send stops with a message naming it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder Anbieter erhält nur die Einstellungen, die er akzeptiert. Kann ein Anbieter eine Einstellung nicht verwenden, bricht das Senden mit einer Meldung ab, die sie nennt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个服务商只会收到它所接受的设置。如果服务商无法使用某项设置，发送会中止并提示该设置的名称。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "각 제공업체에는 그 업체가 받아들이는 설정만 전송돼요. 제공업체가 어떤 설정을 쓸 수 없으면 해당 설정 이름과 함께 전송이 중단돼요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждый провайдер получает только те настройки, которые принимает. Если провайдер не может использовать настройку, отправка прерывается с сообщением, где она названа."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each record is chained to the one before it with SHA-256. Use Verify Integrity from the Insights menu to check the whole log." : {},
    "Each script that changes anything is shown for your approval before it runs. Read-only scripts run automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedes Skript, das etwas ändert, wird dir vor dem Ausführen zur Bestätigung angezeigt. Rein lesende Skripte laufen automatisch."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "무언가를 변경하는 스크립트는 실행 전에 승인하도록 표시됩니다. 읽기 전용 스크립트는 자동으로 실행됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждый скрипт, который что-то изменяет, показывается вам на подтверждение перед запуском. Скрипты только для чтения запускаются автоматически."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任何会做出更改的脚本都会在运行前显示，等待你的确认。只读脚本会自动运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任何會做出更改的腳本都會在運行前顯示，等待你的確認。只讀腳本會自動運行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
