    "What this corpus contains, shown to agents" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was dieser Korpus enthält; wird Agenten angezeigt"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 자료의 내용 설명, 에이전트에게 표시됩니다"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Что содержит этот корпус, показывается агентам"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "描述该资料库的内容，会展示给智能体"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "描述此資料庫的內容，會顯示給代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you add credits or use an Osaurus Router model, it shows up here with its amount. If this Mac made a request, you can jump to the chat or Insights." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn Sie Credits hinzufügen oder ein Osaurus-Router-Modell verwenden, erscheint es hier mit dem Betrag. Wenn dieser Mac eine Anfrage gestellt hat, können Sie zum Chat oder zu Insights springen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "크레딧을 추가하거나 Osaurus Router 모델을 사용하면 금액과 함께 여기에 표시됩니다. 이 Mac에서 요청을 한 경우 채팅 또는 Insights로 바로 이동할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Когда вы пополняете баланс или используете модель Osaurus Router, это отображается здесь с суммой. Если запрос был сделан с этого Mac, можно перейти к чату или Insights."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当你添加积分或使用 Osaurus Router 模型时，它会连同金额显示在这里。如果这台 Mac 发出过请求，你可以跳转到对应聊天或洞察。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當您添加積分或使用Osaurus路由器模型時，它會連同金額顯示在這裡。如果這臺 Mac 提出了請求，您可以跳轉到聊天或 Insights。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you turn it on for an agent, Browser Use lets that agent browse the web for you — navigating pages, reading content, filling forms, and working through a goal step by step, with every action shown in a live feed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "When you turn it on for an agent, Browser Use lets that agent browse the web for you — navigating pages, reading content, filling forms, and working through a goal step by step, with every action shown in a live feed."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "When you turn it on for an agent, Browser Use lets that agent browse the web for you — navigating pages, reading content, filling forms, and working through a goal step by step, with every action shown in a live feed."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "When you turn it on for an agent, Browser Use lets that agent browse the web for you — navigating pages, reading content, filling forms, and working through a goal step by step, with every action shown in a live feed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当你为智能体开启浏览器使用时，该智能体可以为你浏览网页 — 导航页面、阅读内容、填写表单并逐步完成目标，每个操作都在实时动态中显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當你為智能體開啟瀏覽器使用時，該智能體可以為你瀏覽網頁 — 導航頁面、閱讀內容、填寫表單並逐步完成目標，每個操作都在即時動態中顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
