    "Summarizes older messages with the current chat model to free up context (one cloud request). The visible chat is unchanged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fasst ältere Nachrichten mit dem aktuellen Chat-Modell zusammen, um Kontext freizugeben (eine Cloud-Anfrage). Der sichtbare Chat bleibt unverändert."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "현재 채팅 모델로 이전 메시지를 요약해 컨텍스트를 확보합니다(클라우드 요청 1회). 보이는 채팅은 바뀌지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Сжимает старые сообщения текущей моделью чата, чтобы освободить контекст (один облачный запрос). Видимый чат не меняется."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用当前聊天模型总结较早的消息以释放上下文（一次云端请求）。可见的聊天内容保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Summarizes the older part of this chat with the current model (one cloud request). The full chat stays visible." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
