    },
    "Every document has a category, from its frontmatter `type:` or inferred from its folder name. Agents can filter this collection by category." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Every document has a category, from its frontmatter `type:` or inferred from its folder name. Agents can filter this collection by category."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Every document has a category, from its frontmatter `type:` or inferred from its folder name. Agents can filter this collection by category."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Every document has a category, from its frontmatter `type:` or inferred from its folder name. Agents can filter this collection by category."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个文档都有类别，来自其前置元数据 `type:` 或从其文件夹名称推断。智能体可以按类别过滤此集合。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個文件都有類別，來自其前置元資料 `type:` 或從其資料夾名稱推斷。代理可以按類別過濾此集合。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every document has a category, so agents can filter the library by it. Categories come from frontmatter `type:` or are inferred automatically from folder names." : {
      "comment" : "Help text for the \"Knowledge\" collection card, explaining that each document in the collection must have a category, which can be specified in the frontmatter or inferred from the folder name.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Every document has a category, so agents can filter the library by it. Categories come from frontmatter `type:` or are inferred automatically from folder names."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Every document has a category, so agents can filter the library by it. Categories come from frontmatter `type:` or are inferred automatically from folder names."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Every document has a category, so agents can filter the library by it. Categories come from frontmatter `type:` or are inferred automatically from folder names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每篇文档都有一个分类，智能体可以据此筛选文档库。分类来源于前置元数据中的 type: 字段，也可根据文件夹名称自动推断。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每份文件都有一個分類，代理可據此篩選文件庫。分類來源為前置資訊中的 `type:` 欄位，也可根據資料夾名稱自動推斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every file an agent creates, edits, or deletes is snapshotted so it can be reverted from the chat's File Changes panel. Older history can be cleared automatically; history you remove can no longer be reverted." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how long a chat's file history is retained.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Datei, die ein Agent erstellt, bearbeitet oder löscht, wird gesichert, damit sie sich im Bereich „Dateiänderungen“ des Chats zurücksetzen lässt. Älterer Verlauf kann automatisch gelöscht werden; entfernter Verlauf lässt sich nicht mehr zurücksetzen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "에이전트가 만들거나, 편집하거나, 삭제하는 모든 파일은 스냅샷으로 저장되어 채팅의 파일 변경 패널에서 되돌릴 수 있습니다. 오래된 기록은 자동으로 지울 수 있으며, 지운 기록은 더 이상 되돌릴 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждый файл, который агент создаёт, изменяет или удаляет, сохраняется снимком, чтобы его можно было откатить на панели «Изменения файлов» в чате. Старую историю можно очищать автоматически; удалённую историю откатить уже нельзя."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体创建、编辑或删除的每个文件都会保存快照，以便在聊天的“文件更改”面板中还原。较早的历史记录可以自动清除；已移除的历史记录将无法再还原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every file is back to how it was before this chat." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Datei ist wieder auf dem Stand vor diesem Chat."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 파일이 이 대화 이전 상태로 돌아갔습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Все файлы вернулись к состоянию до этого чата."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有文件都已恢复到此对话之前的状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every revert is recorded, so you can undo it afterwards." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedes Zurücksetzen wird aufgezeichnet und kann danach rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 되돌리기는 기록되므로 나중에 취소할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждый откат записывается, поэтому его можно отменить."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次还原都会被记录，之后可以撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every run and every change, with a full audit trail." : {
      "comment" : "Help text for the \"History\" section in the database workspace.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
