    "The 256-bit encryption key lives in your macOS Keychain. It never leaves this Mac and is not synced to iCloud." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The 256-bit encryption key lives in your macOS Keychain. It never leaves this Mac and is not synced to iCloud."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "256비트 암호화 키는 macOS 키체인에 저장됩니다. 이 Mac을 벗어나지 않으며 iCloud에 동기화되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "256-битный ключ шифрования находится в вашей Связке ключей macOS. Он никогда не покидает этот Mac и не синхронизируется с iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "256 位加密密钥存储在你的 macOS 钥匙串中。它永远不会离开这台 Mac，并且不会同步到 iCloud。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "256位加密密鑰存儲在您的macOS鑰匙串中。它永遠不會離開這臺Mac，並且不會同步到iCloud。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent adds rows when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat, or import a file." : {
      "comment" : "Description of what happens when a table is empty.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The agent adds rows when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat, or import a file."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The agent adds rows when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat, or import a file."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The agent adds rows when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat, or import a file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体在有需要记住的内容时会添加行。你也可以直接在聊天中询问，或导入文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
